# Notes

The model performed well overall, especially for Hardhat and Safety Vest detection.

NO-Hardhat was the most challenging class, with a recall of 0.551. This weakness was also seen during demo testing when ShieldSight detected a worker but failed to flag the worker as NO-Hardhat.
